From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:58:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 23/49] fix: review findings on the upstream rebuild

- EncryptionKeyField: await InspectEncryptionKeyFile (a Wails Promise) and
  drop stale answers, so the fingerprint, the reason and the paper key
  controls actually show.
- VM config: OVMF follows the selected boot disk's GPT, not the
  lowest-index disk's (bootDiskIsGPT replaced by diskIsGPT).
- Provisioning: a changed schedule time always recomputes nextRun, even
  when the declared job carries a stale one.
- Standalone migration: a legacy NimbusBackup folder marked as copied is
  never used as a source again.
